WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,660 --> 00:00:02,300
I'm not in a hurry, let them go first

2
00:00:02,540 --> 00:00:03,540
The Holy Son of Haoran Sect

3
00:00:03,540 --> 00:00:04,500
Brother, be broad-minded

4
00:00:04,700 --> 00:00:06,980
The opportunity is left to everyone. What about you?

5
00:00:07,260 --> 00:00:09,940
Why don't you go in? I'm waiting for the Holy Son.

6
00:00:10,940 --> 00:00:12,060
You two are poisonous men

7
00:00:12,060 --> 00:00:13,620
What are you holding back and searching for ideas?

8
00:00:14,260 --> 00:00:15,860
Brother, it was my fault just now

9
00:00:15,980 --> 00:00:18,820
To express my apology, please go in first, Chief.

10
00:00:19,140 --> 00:00:20,940
He asked me to go in first

11
00:00:22,320 --> 00:00:24,710
Thank you, Holy Son, Holy Son.

12
00:00:25,150 --> 00:00:26,110
I was wrong before

13
00:00:26,430 --> 00:00:29,630
Please forgive me. I will go first. Go quickly. Go quickly.

14
00:00:32,460 --> 00:00:33,780
If you're scared, just say so.

15
00:00:34,340 --> 00:00:35,980
Don't you want to escape?

16
00:00:35,980 --> 00:00:38,140
Whatever Prince Xia said, you should go in quickly.

17
00:00:38,300 --> 00:00:40,060
Just think of it as my apology for beating you up last night.

18
00:00:40,060 --> 00:00:41,100
shut your stinky mouth

19
00:00:41,580 --> 00:00:43,700
As expected, he is a soft-spoken person who is afraid of the tough. Now he knows

20
00:00:43,700 --> 00:00:45,580
My Miao became smaller in front of the three major gods.

21
00:00:45,740 --> 00:00:47,820
Yes, yes, everything you said is true. Come on in.

22
00:00:58,440 --> 00:00:59,840
What's going on with this kid?

23
00:01:00,040 --> 00:01:01,840
Give up the chance to go in first

24
00:01:02,200 --> 00:01:03,840
I think he wants to escape

25
00:01:03,960 --> 00:01:05,320
I can't help but look like a human being.

26
00:01:05,480 --> 00:01:07,320
What do I think about his look?

27
00:01:07,720 --> 00:01:09,520
It doesn't look like I'm running away.
